# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:15
translate italian juliana3_d10e8604:

    # "I sit down and start studying with Juliana."
    "Mi siedo e inizio a studiare con Juliana."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:18
translate italian juliana3_b74be5eb:

    # "A few minutes into working on my essay for English class, I catch a glimpse of her staring at me."
    "Dopo pochi minuti che lavoro al mio saggio per la lezione di inglese, la vedo di sfuggita che mi fissa."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:23
translate italian juliana3_e3606a98:

    # "I keep on working, and eventually she goes back to looking at her computer, but has a strange smile on her face."
    "Continuo a lavorare e alla fine lei torna a guardare il suo computer, ma ha uno strano sorriso sul viso."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:25
translate italian juliana3_467078e7:

    # "I look up at her."
    "Alzo lo sguardo verso di lei."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:28
translate italian juliana3_dbd19896:

    # "She immediately turns away, embarrassed."
    "Lei distoglie immediatamente lo sguardo, imbarazzata."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:29
translate italian juliana3_c8017a7f:

    # pc "Did you need something?"
    pc "Avevi bisogno di qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:30
translate italian juliana3_cbe6926b:

    # bn "Oh, um, yes."
    bn "Oh, ehm, sì."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:32
translate italian juliana3_3f6b775b:

    # bn "I just wanted to ask you what you thought about the short story we were supposed to read for the next test?"
    bn "Volevo solo chiederti cosa ne pensavi del racconto che dovevamo leggere per il prossimo compito in classe?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:33
translate italian juliana3_81a81d72:

    # bn "\"The Lottery,\" by Shirley Jackson?"
    bn " “La lotteria”, di Shirley Jackson?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:34
translate italian juliana3_fef12cf2:

    # bn "Did you read it yet?"
    bn "L’hai già letto?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:37
translate italian juliana3_376a98f7:

    # pc "Yeah, I thought it was really messed up."
    pc "Sì, l’ho trovato davvero inquietante."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:39
translate italian juliana3_338df114:

    # bn "Right?"
    bn "Vero?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:40
translate italian juliana3_bfd59367:

    # bn "But I loved it. I thought it really spoke to how things are today in the world with cancel-culture and hive-think."
    bn "Ma mi è piaciuto tantissimo. Ho pensato che rispecchiasse davvero come stanno le cose oggi nel mondo, con la cultura della cancellazione e il pensiero gregario."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:41
translate italian juliana3_bec7d038:

    # pc "Absolutely. The way society seems to choose a person almost at random every couple of months to just destroy."
    pc "Assolutamente. Il modo in cui la società sembra scegliere una persona quasi a caso ogni due mesi solo per distruggerla."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:43
translate italian juliana3_2fe4098b:

    # bn "Exactly! Shirley Jackson seemed to notice this even back in the pre-Twitter days of the 1940's and we're still doing the same thing today."
    bn "Esatto! Shirley Jackson sembrava averlo notato già negli anni ’40, prima dell’avvento di Twitter, e noi continuiamo a fare la stessa cosa ancora oggi."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:44
translate italian juliana3_d42061c8:

    # bn "It's kind of crazy when you think about how little we've changed in nearly 80 years."
    bn "È un po’ pazzesco se pensi a quanto poco siamo cambiati in quasi 80 anni."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:46
translate italian juliana3_4978b7b3:

    # pc "Yeah, I read it."
    pc "Sì, l’ho letto."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:48
translate italian juliana3_aa3188bb:

    # bn "What did you think about it?"
    bn "Che ne pensi?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:49
translate italian juliana3_42049acb:

    # pc "It was good. It was really cool when the person won the lottery."
    pc "Era bello. È stato davvero forte quando quella persona ha vinto alla lotteria."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:51
translate italian juliana3_9f337d9f:

    # bn "It was cool when they chose a person at random and then stoned them in the middle of the town?"
    bn "È stato forte quando hanno scelto una persona a caso e poi l’hanno lapidata in mezzo alla città?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:52
translate italian juliana3_5bb78b12:

    # pc "Wait, what?"
    pc "Aspetta, cosa?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:53
translate italian juliana3_5a363cf3:

    # bn "You didn't read it."
    bn "Non l’hai letto."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:54
translate italian juliana3_0c160447:

    # pc "I didn't read it."
    pc "Non l’ho letto."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:55
translate italian juliana3_5a937e4f:

    # bn "Well you should. It's really interesting and not that long. Plus, you know... grades."
    bn "Beh, dovresti. È davvero interessante e non è poi così lungo. E poi, sai... i voti."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:58
translate italian juliana3_13efba33:

    # bn "Oh okay. Well I think you might like it."
    bn "Oh, ok. Beh, penso che potrebbe piacerti."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:59
translate italian juliana3_906d25f8:

    # bn "I thought it was great. It's kind of crazy how much this story she wrote in the 1940s is still relevant today."
    bn "A me è piaciuto tantissimo. È pazzesco quanto questa storia che ha scritto negli anni ’40 sia ancora attuale oggi."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:60
translate italian juliana3_3a967afc:

    # bn "It made me think a lot about cancel-culture and hive-think and traditions. It's really interesting."
    bn "Mi ha fatto riflettere molto sulla “cultura della cancellazione”, sul pensiero di gregge e sulle tradizioni. È davvero interessante."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:61
translate italian juliana3_c617b9bc:

    # pc "Well now I'm really looking forward to checking it out."
    pc "Beh, ora non vedo l’ora di dargli un’occhiata."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:63
translate italian juliana3_6af83129:

    # "We went back to studying a little bit, until it was time to go to class."
    "Siamo tornati a studiare un po’, finché non è arrivato il momento di andare a lezione."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:65
translate italian juliana3_a3b2a8a1:

    # bn "I'm really enjoying these morning study sessions, [pcname]. I hope they're helpful to you."
    bn "Mi piacciono davvero queste sessioni di studio mattutine, [pcname]. Spero che ti siano utili."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:66
translate italian juliana3_27133e98:

    # pc "Oh they definitely are. I'm enjoying them too."
    pc "Oh, lo sono sicuramente. Piacciono anche a me."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:68
translate italian juliana3_4db47928:

    # bn "Good, I'm glad."
    bn "Bene, ne sono felice."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:69
translate italian juliana3_564926ab:

    # bn "Maybe we could do more um, studying sometime."
    bn "Magari potremmo dedicarci un po’ di più allo studio, qualche volta."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:72
translate italian juliana3_1bcf3ec2:

    # bn "Me too."
    bn "Anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:73
translate italian juliana3_42a0f7ac:

    # bn "Okay, I'll see you in class, [pcname]."
    bn "Ok, ci vediamo a lezione, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:74
translate italian juliana3_2f9bd46c:

    # bn "Bye."
    bn "Ciao."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:77
translate italian juliana3_99274675:

    # bn "No, I just mean studying."
    bn "No, intendo solo studiare."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:78
translate italian juliana3_3b72cdbb:

    # bn "Not a date, nothing like that, just studying."
    bn "Non un appuntamento, niente del genere, solo studiare."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:79
translate italian juliana3_b7f25017:

    # bn "I should go, I'll see you in class."
    bn "Devo andare, ci vediamo a lezione."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:80
translate italian juliana3_be151bf5:

    # bn "Bye"
    bn "Ciao"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:83
translate italian juliana3_f4127d98:

    # bn "What do you mean?"
    bn "Cosa intendi?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:84
translate italian juliana3_9c299014:

    # bn "Are you talking about sex stuff?"
    bn "Stai parlando di cose di sesso?"

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:85
translate italian juliana3_dd64a4d7:

    # bn "That's not at all what I was thinking about."
    bn "Non è affatto quello a cui stavo pensando."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:86
translate italian juliana3_61af0dfb:

    # bn "Just studying, that's all."
    bn "Solo studiare, tutto qui."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:88
translate italian juliana3_5e33a611:

    # bn "I should go. I'll see you in class."
    bn "Devo andare. Ci vediamo a lezione."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:89
translate italian juliana3_2f9bd46c_1:

    # bn "Bye."
    bn "Ciao."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:92
translate italian juliana3_9dbe4ff7:

    # "She immediately packs up all of her things and rushes off out of the café, her face turning red."
    "Lei raccoglie immediatamente tutte le sue cose e si precipita fuori dal bar, arrossendo."

# game/Scenes/Juliana/juliana3.rpy:93
translate italian juliana3_d69c9faa:

    # "I wait just a bit, then pack up my things as well and head to class."
    "Aspetto un attimo, poi raccolgo anch’io le mie cose e mi dirigo a lezione."

